  "text": "[header]\nBenefits Portal\n[nav]\nHome Apply Check status Help\n[form]\n[Search]\n[main]\n# Apply for household energy assistance\nComplete all required fields (marked * ). Your application is saved when you submit; you can return with your confirmation number.\nBefore you start\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\nProof of identity for each adult in the household\nMost recent utility bill\nIncome statements for the last 30 days\n[form]\n1. Applicant\nFirst name *\nLast name *\nDate of birth *\nSocial Security number (last 4)\nOptional. Speeds up identity verification.\nEmail address *\nPhone\n2. Address\nStreet address *\nApartment, suite, etc.\nCity *\nState *\nZIP code *\nMailing address is the same as above\n3. Household\nNumber of people in household *\nHousing type\nOwn\nRent\nOther\nAnyone in the household is… (check all that apply)\nAge 60 or older\nLiving with a disability\nUnder 6 years old\nA veteran\nPrimary heating source\n4. Income\nTotal gross monthly household income (USD) *\nUpload your most recent utility bill\nPDF, JPG or PNG up to 10 MB.\nAnything else we should know?\n5. Review and sign\nPrivacy Act statement\nPenalty for false statements\nI certify that the information provided is true and complete *\nType your full name as signature *\n[Submit application] [Save and finish later] [Clear form]\nNeed help? Call 1-800-555-0100 (TTY 711), Monday–Friday 8 am–6 pm.\n[aside]\n### Related\nAbout the program\nEligibility checker\nCheck application status\nAppeals process\n### Languages\nEspañol\n中文\nTiếng Việt\n[footer]\n[nav]\nAccessibility Privacy FOIA No FEAR Act USA.gov\n© Fixture Corp. Static corpus for engine benchmarks.",
